msgstr "VM Tools Installed"

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:304
msgid ""
"Indicates guest tools are present (VMware Tools for VMware, QEMU Guest "
"Agent for HVM). When unchecked, |morpheus| skips network wait during "
"provisioning."
